00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:06,000
Sing is a 2016 American animated jukebox musical comedy film written and directed by Garth
Jennings, produced by Illumination Entertainment, and distributed by Universal Pictures.

11
00:49:30,000 --> 00:49:36,000
The film stars the voices of Matthew McConaughey, Reese
Witherspoon, Seth MacFarlane, Scarlett Johansson, John C.

12
00:54:00,000 --> 00:54:06,000
Reilly, Taron Egerton, Tori Kelly, Jennifer Saunders,
Jennifer Hudson, Peter Serafinowicz and Nick Kroll.

13
00:58:30,000 --> 00:58:36,000
Set in a world inhabited by anthropomorphic animals, the film focuses on a koala named Buster Moon, a struggling theater owner who stages a singing competition in
an effort to prevent his theater from entering foreclosure, as well as how the competition interferes with the personal lives of its contestants.

14
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
The film features more than 60 songs from famous
artists, mostly performed diegetically.

15
01:07:30,000 --> 01:07:36,000
It also has an original song by Stevie Wonder and Ariana Grande
called "Faith", which was nominated for a Golden Globe.

16
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
Aside from these songs, Joby Talbot (Jennings’ frequent
collaborator) composed the film's score.

17
01:16:30,000 --> 01:16:36,000
Sing first screened during the Toronto International Film Festival on September 11, 2016,
followed by its premiere at the Microsoft Theater in Los Angeles on December 3.

18
01:21:00,000 --> 01:21:06,000
It was then theatrically released in the United States on December 21.

19
01:25:30,000 --> 01:25:36,000
It marked the first time Illumination released two films in the same year,
following the release of The Secret Life of Pets six months earlier.

20
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
It received mostly positive reviews and grossed $634
million worldwide on a $75 million budget.

21
01:34:30,000 --> 01:34:36,000
A sequel, Sing 2, was released on December 22, 2021.

22
01:39:00,000 --> 01:39:06,000
The film explores themes of anthropomorphism, singing,
animals, flood, singing competition.

23
01:43:30,000 --> 01:43:36,000
The tone is lighthearted.
